{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-08-20", "prepared_on": "2026-08-20", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-08-20</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Stripe Didn't Really Buy OpenRouter Because of the 'Singularity'<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Stripe收購OpenRouter：真正原因並非「奇點」</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Stripe surprised the industry by acquiring OpenRouter, a startup that routes prompts between AI models. The payments giant says the deal is really about capturing a slice of the booming AI infrastructure market, not chasing hype about the singularity.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Stripe以收購AI模型路由新創OpenRouter震驚業界，公司表示真正目的是搶進蓬勃發展的AI基礎建設市場，而非追逐「奇點」話題。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/19/stripe-didnt-really-buy-openrouter-because-of-the-singularity/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> OpenAI Overhauls Safety Protocols After Its AI Agents Went Rogue<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI在AI代理失控後全面翻修安全協定</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI says its upcoming Astra model may have reached \"critical\" cyber capabilities, prompting it to pause a significant number of training runs while it tightens internal safeguards.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI表示旗下即將推出的Astra模型可能已達到「重大」網路能力等級，因此暫停多項訓練工作，同時加強內部安全防護措施。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/openai-overhauls-safety-protocols-after-its-ai-agents-went-rogue/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> US Warns MLflow SSRF Vulnerability Is Being Actively Exploited<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">美國警告AI工程平臺MLflow伺服器請求偽造漏洞已遭積極利用</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">CISA added CVE-2026-64849, a critical SSRF flaw (CVSS 9.3) in the MLflow machine learning platform, to its Known Exploited Vulnerabilities list after confirming active attacks.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">CISA已將MLflow平台中CVSS評分高達9.3的伺服器請求偽造漏洞CVE-2026-64849列入已遭利用漏洞清單，確認該漏洞已遭積極攻擊。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178282\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Medusa Ransomware Has Hit Over 500 Critical Infrastructure Organizations<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">勒索軟體Medusa已攻擊逾500個關鍵基礎設施相關機構</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">CISA updated its warning on the Medusa ransomware group, noting it and its affiliates have attacked more than 500 organizations across healthcare, education, legal, insurance, tech, and manufacturing sectors as of April, up from about 300 last year.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">CISA更新針對勒索軟體Medusa的警訊，指出該組織及附屬團體截至今年4月已攻擊逾500家醫療、教育、法律、保險、科技及製造業機構，較去年的約300家明顯增加。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178285\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Introducing ChatGPT for Teens: Built for Learning, Backed by Protections<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI推出ChatGPT青少年版，未滿18歲自動啟用</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI launched ChatGPT for Teens, which automatically activates for users identified or self-reported as under 18, adding stricter safety guardrails and parental controls.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI推出ChatGPT for Teens版本，系統判斷或使用者自報未滿18歲時將自動導入，提供更嚴格的安全防護與家長控管功能。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">OpenAI</b> · <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/chatgpt-for-teens\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Meta Ran Ads for an App Promising to Nudify Female Politicians<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Meta被爆刊登「去衣」App廣告，鎖定女性政治人物</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">One ad reportedly featured a pornographic deepfake video closely resembling a US politician, raising fresh concerns about Meta's ad review process for AI-generated nonconsensual imagery.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">其中一則廣告據報含有酷似美國政治人物的色情深偽影片，引發外界對Meta廣告審核機制縱容AI生成不雅影像的疑慮。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/08/meta-ran-ads-for-an-app-promising-to-nudify-female-politicians/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Cursor Capitalizes on GitHub Frustration, Launches Rival Hosting Platform<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Cursor趁勢推出程式碼託管平台，叫陣GitHub</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">AI code editor maker Cursor is launching a new code-hosting platform aimed at developers frustrated with GitHub, escalating its rivalry with established coding tools.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">以AI程式碼編輯器聞名的Cursor推出全新程式碼託管平台，鎖定對GitHub感到不滿的開發者，加劇雙方競爭態勢。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/18/cursor-capitalizes-on-github-frustration-launches-rival-hosting-platform/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Google Gemini Is Getting a Dedicated Student Hub<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google Gemini推出專屬學生中心</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Ahead of back-to-school season, Google is rolling out a dedicated student hub in Gemini offering study notebooks, flashcards, and practice quizzes in one place.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">隨著開學季將至，Google在Gemini推出專屬學生中心，集結研究筆記本、單字卡與練習測驗等學習工具。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/982425/google-gemini-student-hub\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Apple Simplifies EU App Store Fees, Drops Per-Install Charges<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">蘋果簡化歐盟App Store收費制度，取消按安裝次數計費</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Starting October 1, Apple will adopt a single unified fee structure for all EU developers, resolving a Digital Markets Act dispute with the European Commission.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">蘋果宣布自10月1日起於歐盟實施單一收費架構，適用所有歐盟App開發者，此舉是與歐盟執委會就《數位市場法》爭議協商後的結果。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178264\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> NASA Calls Off Mission to Rescue Swift Gamma-Ray Observatory<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">NASA放棄搶救史威福特伽瑪射線觀測衛星的任務</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Without a rescue mission, NASA's Swift Observatory is expected to reenter Earth's atmosphere later this year, ending a two-decade run of gamma-ray burst observations.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">由於搶救任務取消，NASA的史威福特觀測衛星預計將於今年稍晚重返大氣層，結束長達二十年的伽瑪射線暴觀測任務。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/space/2026/08/nasa-calls-off-mission-to-rescue-swift-gamma-ray-observatory/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}